{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Tinker: an attack swing in the Mechsuit ends the client's attack state (#11860)",
  "contract": [
    "Build: Mechsuit (801384) mounts the Tinker through 803451, and the server keeps that mount when the client asks to dismount before an attack.",
    "Unit::Attack refuses a mounted player, so a swing from the suit starts no melee. The server must then answer the client's CMSG_ATTACKSWING (321) with SMSG_ATTACKSTOP (324); without it the client stays in attack mode and every later click on a hostile unit starts an attack.",
    "CONTROL: out of the suit, the same swing starts melee on the target and sends no SMSG_ATTACKSTOP."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 60000,
